   ("Can I get a same-week appointment in Hartford?", "Usually, yes. Hartford is our base, so local vehicles are the easiest for us to slot in. Call or text 414-286-1609 and we will tell you honestly what we have open."),
   ("Do you detail vehicles that have been sitting all winter?", "Yes, and those are often the ones that benefit most. Salt residue, moisture and a stale smell build up over a Wisconsin winter. A full interior with extraction resets it rather than masking it."),
