   ("Do you serve Dodge County?", "Yes. Rubicon is about twelve minutes from our shop at 2948 WI-83 in Hartford, which makes it closer than several Washington County communities we serve."),
   ("Can you clean lime and fertiliser film off a vehicle?", "Usually, but tell us when you book. Alkaline lime film needs different chemistry from ordinary road grime, and turning up prepared makes a real difference to the result."),
   ("My truck is genuinely filthy. Will you turn it away?", "No. We will quote it honestly before we start rather than after. If we think it needs more than one visit to put right, we will tell you that too."),
